# the design document is kept internal and lives outside this checkout. This
# entry is the second line of defence: a copy pasted back in during a working
# session cannot be committed by accident. `test/doctor.test.ts` is the first —
# it fails if any comment, string, schema description or README line in the
# tree cites the document, so the code cannot come to depend on it again.
DESIGN.md
